  "bodyHash": "cc4b871b52dbf52b",
  "content": "\n\n<p>Only Bags 添加了 4 款风格独特的背包，让你能够携带更多物品，相当于多了一个物品栏。背包从铁质到下界合金，每种比前一种拥有更多槽位：</p>\n<p>铁背包：15 个槽位</p>\n<p>金背包：26 个槽位</p>\n<p>钻石背包：43 个槽位</p>\n<p>下界合金背包：64 个槽位</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>版本记录：</p>\n<p>2.0.0 版本为模组添加了西班牙语翻译</p>\n<p>1.5.0 版本为模组添加了成就系统</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1206654/description_edb8fd23-d66e-496a-be51-e22ba63f0fe9.png\" width=\"797\" height=\"212\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_aef9ea86-9e8f-4316-875c-7330489a86b3.png\" width=\"832\" height=\"528\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_84995412-c107-472f-abec-f70c0bd1f399.png\" width=\"802\" height=\"354\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_e21284f5-5f98-42c3-9758-c143d6795c92.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"375\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_1b7de9ed-6672-48e2-a176-d2e5e78ebc6e.png\" width=\"803\" height=\"354\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_7683c9f7-2ff9-4909-9b88-c49b86b94fd0.png\" width=\"803\" height=\"369\"></p>",
